WEBVTT

00:00:01.070 --> 00:00:02.550
Stand fast, Weaver!

00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:04.850
Together, we fight!

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.650
For the sketchbook!

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.250
The Alliance must hold strong now.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:13.150
I will guide you through the dark.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.400
Trust the Ink Fox and move forward.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:22.600
By the light of color, I protect this realm.

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:26.050
We must unite our worlds.

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:28.300
Strike the thread with shadow's ink!

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:31.350
Behold, the Fox of Light.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:34.850
Let the light restore all that was lost.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:44.100
We stand victorious. Behold, Sketchic.net.
